      "tag": "Week",
      "h2": "All Seven",
      "body_html": "<p>The French week starts with <strong>lundi</strong>. Then: <strong>mardi, mercredi, jeudi, vendredi, samedi, dimanche</strong>. Notice that French days <strong>do not</strong> have capital letters.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Today",
      "h2": "Saying Today",
      "body_html": "<p>'Today is...' = <strong>Aujourd'hui c'est...</strong>. So 'Aujourd'hui c'est mardi' = today is Tuesday. <strong>Demain</strong> = tomorrow, <strong>hier</strong> = yesterday.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "On",
      "h2": "On Mondays",
      "body_html": "<p>To say 'on Mondays' (every Monday) use <strong>le lundi</strong>. 'Le samedi je joue au football' = 'On Saturdays I play football'.</p>"
    }
  ],
